                "J. Falco, K. Van Wyk, S. Liu, and S. Carpin, \"Grasping the Performance: Facilitating Replicable Performance Measures via Benchmarking and Standardized Methodologies,\" <em>IEEE Robot. Automat. Mag.</em>, vol. 22, no. 4, pp. 125–136, Dec. 2015, doi: <a href='https://doi.org/10.1109/MRA.2015.2460891'>10.1109/MRA.2015.2460891</a>."
              ]
